    "text": "I, Nagalingam Regan, Returning Officer of the Manmunai South and Eruvil Pattu Pradeshiya Sabha, do hereby declare under Section 10A(1)(a) of the (Chapter 262) Local Authorities Elections Ordinance that Mr. Tharmareththinam Suthakaran of the Manmunai South and Eruvil Pattu Pradeshiya Sabha has vacated his office of member of that Pradeshiya Sabha as he has been ceased to be a member of the Thamil Makkal Viduthalai Pulikal.",
